#. module: ssi_school_deposit_operating_unit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_deposit_operating_unit.field_school_deposit_type__interunit_account_id
msgid ""
"Account that links the two journals of a realization that uses a deposit "
"recorded in another operating unit. It must allow reconciliation. Required "
"before such a realization can be finished."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_school_deposit_operating_unit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_deposit_operating_unit.field_school_deposit_realization__interunit_move_ids
msgid ""
"Additional journal entries, one per source operating unit, created when a "
"line takes its deposit from another operating unit. Each debits the deposit "
"account and credits the Interunit Account of the Type."
msgstr ""

